        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/ba9def/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-22T17:28:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've been lurking on these boards for a while now, the community here is just great.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I do have another question tho, regarding the first turn in a game. It seems odd, but is move an unavailable option first turn, as you have not yet rolled to see what your move range is? When we played it a few times, it seemed like sprint was the only mobility option to start with, unless you ad something like BB's teleport to move you about.</p>",
